    "questionSummary": "101冷备如何更新R55并保留旧资产、语音材料和独立软件工厂，避免把程序就绪冒作接管验收？",
    "context": {
      "observedAt": "2026-10-18T16:32:45.598Z",
      "goalSpecHash": null,
      "sourceFingerprint": "81f10ed981d22895a6747704e6e946929c5654c8db6c5950a9c2fccb9bbad42a",
